  "description": "CUR-ID (F: Requery confounded by population), variant: a retained Bookmark after Requery once the dynaset is populated again. A dynaset on T moves to ID 3 and reads Bookmark. (1) control: the constant 02 02 00 00 is assigned before Requery; (2) Requery, MoveLast (population complete), the constant is assigned; (3) Requery, Move 2 (rows 1-3 populated), the constant is assigned; (4) Requery with no population, the constant is assigned (repeat of the first card). Errors, BOF, EOF, AbsolutePosition and ID are read after each assignment.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
